@Muse is delightful and is able to handle tasks other agents failed at. I also already have access to other accounts through FB Connect.

And surprisingly, I trust @Meta more than a startup here with my data. Incentives are aligned since data misuse will end in lawsuits that hit market cap and Meta has enough experience here to not cross lines.

I was also at Meta doing ML and know exactly how seriously they take security and privacy.

@alexandr_wang and @finkd cooked here in the most obvious way they would.
